;
; How Folio files one entry of a document's outline in MYRA (folio_rules.h
; FR7): under the document's number and the entry's place in the outline,
; the heading's level (1 a chapter, 2 a section, 3 a subsection), the page
; it starts on and its line in the laid-out document. Folio asks whether
; the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXFOLIO(doc:i9, entry:i4) = level:i1! ^ page:i6! ^ line:i9!
